CORE
four_independent_writes.c
--evaluation-order-check
^Evaluation-order reduction: 4 of 4 side effects commute with all side effects they are unordered with$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The four calls write distinct globals, so each commutes with all others and is
executed once, in the fixed order, rather than in each of the four rounds.
